From: Kuninori Morimoto <kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ASoC: audio-graph-scu-card: use asoc_simple_card_of_parse_routing()
Date: Thu, 15 Jun 2017 00:25:51 +0000
Message-ID: <87shj2m78z.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <8737b2nlxk.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
